> Do people have a good rule of thumb for how many daggers to carry?
> I started with my rogues carrying 10-15, but then started getting crazy and
> was carrying 20-25, but then the weight was just getting unmanagable, so
> I'm back down to 10...  10 seems to cover most encounters but
